A listing's Relative path location shows its depth, and keeps it. Volto offered only Current path and Parent path, drew any other stored path — this page's own children (`.::1`), `..` — as an empty "Select…" while the listing still ran it, and dropped the depth when one was picked. The path now has a Depth beside it, as the Absolute path has, and a path the menu does not offer is shown as it is.
